OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWidely cloudy to start across
OL,6,Fthe north and west with some clearer
OL,7,Fspells in the southeast. Light rain
OL,8,Fmoving in from the northwest, and
OL,9,Fslowly crossing the region through the
OL,10,Fafternoon. Light winds with near
OL,11,Faverage temperatures.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThe rain clears through the
OL,14,Fevening with cloud breaking overnight
OL,15,Fto give clear spells into Saturday
OL,16,Fmorning. Isolated mist and fog patches
OL,17,Fdeveloping by dawn. Colder overnight
OL,18,Fthan last night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,167,160,301,260,100,100
