OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FAny overnight mist and fog
OL,6,Fpatches clear to leave a fine, partly
OL,7,Fcloudy and dry day. Feeling warm in
OL,8,Fthe sunshine with light winds. Cold
OL,9,Fagain overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FAfter a
OL,12,Ffine, if breezy, morning, rain moves
OL,13,Fthrough Sunday afternoon. A pleasant
OL,14,Fday on Monday before an increasingly
OL,15,Fwet and windy day on Tuesday.
OL,16,FTemperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
